  "project_proof_route": "Prove additivity of tensor-section p-th power locally in frames and by sheaf separation. Use the actual Frobenius semilinear scalar map and pullback-pushforward adjunction; prove local surjectivity using powers of frames. Identify the simultaneous relative-Frobenius/projection map on the curve-Jacobian product with absolute Frobenius. Compare actual universal Poincare bundles, deduce multiplication by p by representability, then apply uniqueness of independently descended Verschiebung. Compare the independently constructed cotangent differentials.",
